@organizerId = 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666
@tripId = ed315e6b-c985-4617-a788-ec4c49eda602

---

### TEST 1: Utworzenie nowej wycieczki

POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizerId": "{{organizerId}}",
  "country": "Hiszpania",
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-14",
  "baseCurrency": "EUR",
  "plannedBudget": 2500.00
}

###

### TEST 2: Pobranie szczegółów wycieczki po ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### TEST 3: Pobranie wszystkich wycieczek danego organizatora
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/organizer/{{organizerId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### TEST 4: Pobranie uczestników wycieczki
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/members
Accept: application/json

###

### TEST 5: Zmiana statusu wycieczki
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}